	Move PACMSG feature to ipcm driver

Signed-off-by: zhangdongchuan <zhangdongchuan@eswincomputing.com>
Reviewed-by: Joey Zheng <zhengyu@eswincomputing.com>
---
 arch/riscv/configs/vpu7702_evb_defconfig     |   1 -
 arch/riscv/configs/vpu7702_pcie_a2_defconfig |   1 -
 arch/riscv/configs/vpu7702_pcie_defconfig    |   1 -
 kernel/printk/printk.c                       | 191 -------------------
 lib/Kconfig.debug                            |  14 --
 5 files changed, 208 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/riscv/configs/vpu7702_evb_defconfig b/arch/riscv/configs/vpu7702_evb_defconfig
